8.      Planning as a Seller – sell side M&A

           •   Divestitures as a strategy
           •   Sell side process (auctions), Sell side considerations in selling private vs
               public companies
           •   Splitting to create value –restructuring via demergers / subsidiarisations,
               suitability, and impact on value - through examples [depending on time]

        REQUIRED
          • Dranikoff, Lee, Tim Koller, and Antoon Schneider. “Divestiture: Strategy’s
